[PrintTextModified Text:讨论到此为止，<br>可以请各位进入投票环节了吗？|#CommonBad07_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
[PrintTextModified Text:——我还未能证明自己的清白，<br>典狱长就宣告讨论结束了。|#CommonBad07_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:被众人投票选为【魔女】的是——|#CommonBad07_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

