[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#CommonBad07_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我满怀憎恨，<br>瞪视着在场的每一个少女。|#CommonBad07_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal2,ArmR13,ArmL12,Eyes2_Normal_Closed1,Mouth2_Angry_Open1,Sweat2-1
[PrintTextModified Text:你们是错误的。|#CommonBad07_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就算说了，也无法颠覆判决。<br>尽管如此，我还是重申了一遍。|#CommonBad07_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal2,ArmR12,ArmL12,Eyes2_Angry_Open2,Mouth2_Angry_Open1,Sweat2-1
[PrintTextModified Text:你们……是错的……！|#CommonBad07_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
[PrintTextModified Text:许多怜悯般的视线投向了我。|#CommonBad07_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:心底沸腾的怒火，<br>让我涌起毁掉一切的冲动。|#CommonBad07_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:被冲动驱使的同时，<br>却又觉得付诸行动也是无益。|#CommonBad07_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL12,Eyes1_Angry_Open3,Mouth1_Determined_Closed1,Sweat1-1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Warden.9
[PrintTextModified Text:……好吧。|#CommonBad07_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:【现在】，我会接受这个结果。<br>毕竟我自己没做好，也是咎由自取。|#CommonBad07_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Arms3,Eyes1_Normal_Closed1,Mouth1_Determined_Closed1,Sweat1-1
[PrintTextModified Text:快点结束吧。|#CommonBad07_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……你这么爽快倒是帮了我大忙，<br>不过有点诡异呢。你是不是在搞什么小动作？|#CommonBad07_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Arms3,Eyes1_Normal_Open3,Mouth1_Fearful_Open1
[PrintTextModified Text:没有。<br>事到如今再主张无罪，也只是徒增难堪罢了。|#CommonBad07_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Warden.9
[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#CommonBad07_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不知道典狱长是否理解了我的话，<br>它只例行公事地回应了一句，<br>随后平静地开始推进处刑流程。|#CommonBad07_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Warden.2
[PrintTextModified Text:大家只要按下手机上的处刑按钮，<br>就会开始执行处刑了。|#CommonBad07_Warden005| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
[PrintTextModified Text:在典狱长的催促下，少女们脸色青白，<br>却还是接连按下了按钮。|#CommonBad07_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 処刑ボタンを押す音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_86 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
; ========================================

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.8
[PrintTextModified Text:好了！那么，<br>现在开始执行对魔女的刑罚～|#CommonBad07_Warden006| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 歯車がまわる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_36 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
; ========================================

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
[PrintTextModified Text:随着典狱长一声令下，<br>某处的机关启动了。|#CommonBad07_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:接着，从某处传来了齿轮的转动声，<br>中央的底座颤动了一下。|#CommonBad07_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:地板开了一个洞，底座缓缓地往下降。|#CommonBad07_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看着那取代了原有的底座而出现的【那个东西】，<br>我的心脏剧烈地跳动起来。|#CommonBad07_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那是个像巨大铁棍般的装置。<br>其中央垂下一根绳子。|#CommonBad07_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——是绞刑台。|#CommonBad07_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看守从后面押送着，我走上了绞刑台。|#CommonBad07_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@Wait WaitMode:1.0
; ========================================
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:530_1
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:站在绞刑台上，我抬头瞪视着那根绞索。|#CommonBad07_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:心中感到一阵骚动。<br>【那时】的景象不受控制地在脑海中闪现。|#CommonBad07_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:无法消失、抹去不了的记忆。|#CommonBad07_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:自己的心跳声吵得耳朵发疼。<br>直到这时我才第一次发觉——|#CommonBad07_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我动摇了。|#CommonBad07_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:用来缢颈的绳圈。<br>我珍视的朋友就是被这种东西害死的。|#CommonBad07_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如今。<br>它正向我招手，想要夺走我的生命。<br>它正等待着勒紧我的脖子，扼住我的呼吸。|#CommonBad07_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……紧握的拳头在颤抖。|#CommonBad07_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:没问题。我可以面对。<br>我不会被愤怒和恐惧吞噬。|#CommonBad07_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我挺直身姿，深吸一口气。|#CommonBad07_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
@HideActors ActorIds:Stills Lazy:false
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:已经没事了。我早已做好了觉悟。<br>汹涌的感情，已经彻底平息。|#CommonBad07_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.,Arms4,Eyes1_Normal_Closed1,Mouth1_Cry_Closed1,Sweat1-1,Pale1-1
[PrintTextModified Text:快点结束吧。|#CommonBad07_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看守把绳索套在我的脖子上。|#CommonBad07_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后。<br>脚下的地板打开——|#CommonBad07_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]
