[PrintTextModified Text:二阶堂希罗被处决了。|#CommonBad07_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的魔法是【死亡回溯】。|#CommonBad07_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但她的魔法没有发动。|#CommonBad07_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:用于处刑的绞索，<br>是为了制裁魔女而特制的道具。<br>——它具有封印魔法的效果。|#CommonBad07_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:少女们的互相残杀仍未终结。<br>魔女审判仍在继续——|#CommonBad07_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但希罗已迎来了真正的终结。|#CommonBad07_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

